  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are two matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;satisfying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math>, then <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
